package A
  @@
  System block
  @@
  part B
    @@
    Flag x
    @@
    let x in boolean
    @@
    Flag y
    @@
    let y in boolean
  part
  requirement R1 top bottom 
    on B::x
  is
    eventually B::x or (rising B::y and always falling B::x since B::y or previously B::x)
  requirement
  requirement R2 top bottom 
    on B::y
  is
    @@
    Some tests [[B::y]]
    @@
  requirement
  requirement R3 top bottom 
    on B
  is
    @@
    Some tests [[B]]
    @@
  requirement
package
